msgid ""
"contraseña incorrecta. tras varios intentos fallidos la cuenta se bloquea "
"unos minutos: espera y vuelve a probar."
msgstr ""
"wrong password. after several failed attempts the account is locked for a "
"few minutes: wait and try again."

